                <note rend="inline" type="source">861.77 Chinese Eastern/581: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in the Dominican Republic</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Young</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Santo Domingo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1929-12-04T14:00:00-04:40">December 4, 1929—2
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received December 4—11:15 a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>68. With reference to the Department’s telegram December 1, 3 [<hi
                        rendition="#italic">4</hi>] p.m. The Minister for Foreign Affairs is
                    addressing telegram to Russia and China along the lines indicated and a public
                    statement will be issued.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Young</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
